 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. Last year February to March hit 35% of normal in 2025, and this year June to July is at 139% of normal in 2026 on the middle. Grid 22633 had its driest year in 1966 at 51%.</p>"}
